  "event_seq": 97,
  "root_problem": "Since CHG-77 on 2026-09-09 turned idempotency-key enforcement off with no rollback (E-01), gateway timeout retries on H-CAPTURE are sent without keys and the PSP no longer drops them, so each retry becomes a real second capture (E-02, E-03). This drove double-charge tickets from about 10/week to about 300/week (E-04). Falsifiable: re-enabling enforcement should bring duplicate captures to 0 while retries stay at about 120/day."
 },
